### Using the information to solve

Let's plug $\blueD{d_1'(t_0)}=\blueD{-7}$, $\maroonD{d_2(t_0)}=\maroonD{6}$, $\goldD{d_1(t_0)}=\goldD{4}$, and $\purpleC{d_2'(t_0)}=\purpleC{10}$ into the expression for $A'(t_0)$:

$\begin{align}
A'(t_0)&=\dfrac{\blueD{d_1'(t_0)}\maroonD{d_2(t_0)}+\goldD{d_1(t_0)}\purpleC{d_2'(t_0)}}{2}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{(\blueD{-7})(\maroonD{6})+(\goldD{4})(\purpleC{10})}{2}
\\\\
&=-1
\end{align}$
